#### EC226 專案命名規範快速參考 ####
#### EC226 Project Naming Conventions Quick Reference ####
################################################################################
#
# ✅ 介面 (Interfaces):          IPaymentService, IProductRepository
# ✅ 類別 (Classes):             PaymentConfiguration, CartService
# ✅ 結構 (Structs):             ProductData, OrderInfo
# ✅ 列舉 (Enums):               PaymentMethod, OrderStatus
# ✅ 公開屬性 (Public Props):    MerchantTradeNo, TotalAmount
# ✅ 公開方法 (Public Methods):  GenerateTradeNo(), GetProducts()
# ✅ 私有欄位 (Private Fields):  _unitOfWork, _context, _configuration
# ✅ 非同步方法 (Async Methods): CheckOutAsync(), GetDataAsync()
# ✅ 參數 (Parameters):          merchantId, orderNo, items
# ✅ 區域變數 (Local Vars):      var result, var orderNo, var products
# ✅ ViewModel:                  ProductVM, CheckCartResultVM
#
################################################################################
